WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.580
Everything in Sheprd is a few keystrokes away, in the command palette.

2
00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:12.483
Press Command Shift P: workspaces, terminals, agents and commands, in one list.

3
00:00:13.123 --> 00:00:18.583
Type a few letters and press Return. Here, a split beside the terminal.

4
00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:24.127
The chips at the top narrow the list, for example to commands only.

5
00:00:24.132 --> 00:00:27.432
Escape closes it, right where you left off.
